{"approved":false,"back_sample":{"translation":"Instead of an astronomical ephemeris, use an average recurrence period anchored to a reference new moon. Individual phase times differ in time units, and the UTC date displayed may differ from the local calendar date. This all-earth phase estimation does not calculate local moonrise, moonset, visibility, and religious calendar dates.","truncated":false},"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"moon-phase-calculator UI copy.fields.methodNote","detected_language":"ja","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote","keys":["moon-phase-calculator.copy.fields.methodNote"],"locale":"ja","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"天文学的なエフェメリスではなく、参照の新月にアンカレッジされた平均回帰周期を使用します。個々の位相時間は時間単位で異なり、表示される UTC 日付は地元のカレンダー日付と異なる場合があります。この全地球的な位相推定は地元の月の出、月の入り、可視性、宗教的カレンダーの日付を計算しません。","record_id":"5bf7a1d6102986a0c94fd1375d31a2cffd27c1b8a1a140e358f3655838801858","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":2.1111825595000013,"source":"Uses a mean synodic cycle anchored to a reference new moon, not a full astronomical ephemeris. Individual phase times can differ by hours and the displayed UTC date can differ from a local calendar date. This global phase estimate does not calculate local moonrise, moonset, visibility, or religious calendar dates.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"30870c684a9b7cbcd78603b289a08388959d9db0a9b4d591addd5741a14786a4","status":"machine-draft","translation":"天文学的なエフェメリスではなく、参照の新月にアンカレッジされた平均回帰周期を使用します。個々の位相時間は時間単位で異なり、表示される UTC 日付は地元のカレンダー日付と異なる場合があります。この全地球的な位相推定は地元の月の出、月の入り、可視性、宗教的カレンダーの日付を計算しません。","truncated":false,"warnings":[]}
